<title>USA: BTG gets $17 mln contract from GSA.</title>
<headline>BTG gets $17 mln contract from GSA.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The General Service Administration's Southwest and Heartland regions said Wednesday they awarded a software license contract worth almost $17 million over three years to BTG Inc, a Virginia-based information technology integrator.</p>
</text>
